                "title": "Pipe Door Handle",
                "description": "Rustic is big in home decorating as is the trend to repurpose the things from the home improvement store but often times it ends up looking tacky. The PH-4880 Pipe Door Handle takes those trends and makes it sophisticated. This door pull looks like a pipe, but in a chic way that makes this Rustic Pipe Handle actually look like it belongs on a door instead of in the wall. Oh, and let's not forget about how this RK International door handle is made of quality materials. It is available in an array of finishes. Choose from a 12 inch or an 18 inch length. \r\n",
